# ==========================================================================
# CACHE hoi dap: goi cung mot cau nhieu lan roi xem cache-stats
# ==========================================================================

### Ti le trung cache (chuan hoa + embedding)
GET {{RAG_HostAddress}}/api/query/cache-stats
Accept: application/json

### Goi lan 1 - cache lanh (~5s)
POST {{RAG_HostAddress}}/api/query/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "npcName": "Wills", "npcSystem": "cộc cằn, hay phàn nàn", "Question": "xin chào ông" }

### Goi lai y het - cache am (~0.4s)
POST {{RAG_HostAddress}}/api/query/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "npcName": "Wills", "npcSystem": "cộc cằn, hay phàn nàn", "Question": "xin chào ông" }

### Bien the khong dau - truot cache chuan hoa nhung TRUNG cache embedding
POST {{RAG_HostAddress}}/api/query/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "npcName": "Wills", "npcSystem": "cộc cằn, hay phàn nàn", "Question": "xin chao ong" }

###

# ==========================================================================
# CACHE SONG QUA RESTART
#   File: App_Data/query-cache.bin (nhi phan, ~3KB/vector)
#   Flush dinh ky 300s + flush luc tat. Doi nhanh de test:
#     QueryCache__FlushIntervalSeconds=10 dotnet run --project RAG
# ==========================================================================

### 1. Goi vai cau de tao du lieu cache
POST {{RAG_HostAddress}}/api/query/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "npcName": "Wills", "npcSystem": "cộc cằn, hay phàn nàn", "Question": "xin chào ông" }

### 2. Xem cache-stats truoc khi restart
GET {{RAG_HostAddress}}/api/query/cache-stats
Accept: application/json

### 3. Sau khi restart, goi lai dung cau tren -> phai TRUNG cache ngay
POST {{RAG_HostAddress}}/api/query/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "npcName": "Wills", "npcSystem": "cộc cằn, hay phàn nàn", "Question": "xin chào ông" }

### 4. cache-stats phai co hit ngay o request dau tien sau restart
GET {{RAG_HostAddress}}/api/query/cache-stats
Accept: application/json

###

