POST {{RAG_HostAddress}}/api/query/route-debug
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Question": "cam on ong nhieu" }

### LLM route: tam biet (ky vong farewell)
POST {{RAG_HostAddress}}/api/query/route-debug
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Question": "tạm biệt nhé" }

### LLM route: hoi ve AI (ky vong out_of_scope - guardrail)
POST {{RAG_HostAddress}}/api/query/route-debug
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Question": "bạn là AI phải không" }

### LLM route: cau hoi tri thuc (ky vong null -> di duong RAG)
POST {{RAG_HostAddress}}/api/query/route-debug
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Question": "kiếm sắt giá bao nhiêu" }

